{"summary":"Show off now your playing skills in this fun soccer game!","description":"Golazo! is a dynamic arcade soccer game that is played in medium sized fields with no fouls or offside whistled, really in line with the old times soccer games from the 90’s. And the most important feature of the game are humour and fun! It is so much fun to play it!\n\nGolazo! boldly recalls the glory days of the arcade soccer games, bringing back memories of cult classics we all know. With its vintage, not-too-serious, artistic and creative modern approach to classic gameplay, Golazo! is certainly a perfect game for people who are weary of football managers or complicated hard-core simulators. You just grab your phone and play!\n\nGolazo! is a breakaway from the rigidity of simulators and their realism, the game brings a throwback to retro games with a fluid game play but at the same using nowadays games developing cutting edge technology.\n\nThe game controls are simple and include passing, lobbing and shooting or tackling and pushing the opponent to steal the ball. Once within the matches teams can gain temporary boosts like super-sprint, super-shots or super-tackles.\n\nFeature list:\n\n- Dynamic gameplay reminiscent of cult arcade soccer games\n- Who needs rules? No fouls and offsides!\n- Legendary players used as reference\n- International Cup mode and league\n- 52 national teams\n- 28 hand-drawn managers\n- Humor – soccer simulators are boring. Let’s bring back fun to soccer!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$9.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UqogNiuFlZY?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5dQZMWXEwOifm7n_lZW2GXogmX1dw8BUIeoh9Ufj3nN6eWE_9nwwj0OJUTF5wrfadSSjrUuFiGiRP55P7vkv9w","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bCSqzknuvxPZwcIqOKyA_A69bH5twL37jAVQOLJyEltvCTAd4PfKLp6EEgcW8De--7vC5J6POQ34PvdXOAqJ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HnquFMRkFhQ4C8v9o9SyoUXgi3S4NG4_E1lFYax